      "input": "Lucknow UP. Fictional seller CloudBasket took Rs 2400 for shoes on 10 October 2026, cancelled the order and still hasn't refunded me. I have the invoice, cancellation email and bank statement. Support keeps closing tickets. What can I do?",
      "input_mode": "text",
